# Normalize all text files to LF in the repository. Windows checkouts keep LF
# too (no CRLF conversion), so generated Go/YAML never churns on line endings.
* text=auto eol=lf

# buf embeds proto source comments verbatim into generated openapi/go output,
# so CRLF in .proto leaks \r\n into descriptions. Force LF.
*.proto text eol=lf

# Binary types must never be normalized.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.zst binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
